Driver for Ezi-Servo 2 Plus-E controller
=======================================

Rea Domitrović <redomitro@irb.hr> July 2026

Introduction
------------

This is a Model 3 (asynMotor) FASTech Ezi-Servo 2 Plus-E (EzS2PE) controller by implementing methods from the asynMotorController and asynMotorAxis classes. Communication is established over Ethernet via the UDP protocol for reduced overhead versus TCP.

Overall communication is achieved using ASCII octets, but they are not ASCII-compatible strings; the EzS2PE controller takes binary data as input. For that reason, the asynMotorController::writeReadController method had to be overriden to make everything work as expected.

